- [major] The live_preview block is added with `management_token: ""` (an empty literal) and the prescribed `CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN` was never added to the env destructuring block (lines 23-36). Note: I verified against the installed contentstack SDK's index.d.ts (line 123: `live_preview: { enable: boolean, host: string, management_token: string }`), so deviating from the plan's `preview_token` key is correct — the installed SDK does not declare it. However, with an empty management_token and no preview token wired from env, server-side draft retrieval through this Stack has no credential to authorize draft access, putting AC 1/2/5 (draft content shown instead of published) at risk for any fetch that does not go through the live-preview-utils URL-hash injection. (src/services/contentstack.ts:76)
